    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d794">

                <pb facs="0755" n="749" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg749"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Blaine to Mr. Phelps.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 325.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-11-05"><hi rendition="#italic">November 5,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Adverting to my No. 317, of the 28th
                    ultimo, confirmatory of my telegram to you of the 26th of the same month in
                    relation to the reported resignation of the president of the municipal council
                    of Samoa, I herewith inclose copy of the Department’s note of the 28th ultimo to
                    the minister of Great Britain at this capital, and of his reply of the 31st of
                    the same month upon the subject.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">James G. Blaine.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
